silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_01_representability_proposition_concrete_anchor#hom_neg_mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Hom_neg_Mittens is Hom_neg_Mittens: the representable presheaf Hom(-,MittensColimitApex); assigns to each D_Mittens source object X the set of arrows X -> MittensColimitApex (= the singleton {the X-leg arrow} for each of the twelve source nodes)." .
