    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.chapters.07_yoneda_profile_drill.sections.01_representability_proposition.concrete_anchor#mittenscolimitapex" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_01_representability_proposition_concrete_anchor#mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is MittensColimitApex: the concrete representing object for the representable profile of Mittens; the unique (up to isomorphism) object A such that Hom(-,A) iso ClinicalLabelPresheaf restricted to D_Mittens." .
