silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_01_representability_proposition_concrete_anchor#gptmittensdescription silm:hasLongDescription "The GPTMittensDescription is GPTMittensDescription: a GPT-generated presheaf over D_Mittens that assigns to each source node a text description; this presheaf is not representable by MittensColimitApex because it has no concrete twelve-leg source witness; the cannon/or/gpt_absorption section (05) of paper-00 rules it non-canonical." .
